    "detailed_description": "To Clean The Mountain is a platforming adventure where you throw yourself towards the summit. The spirit of the mountain will talk with you as you traverse a variety of environments.<br><br><br><strong>Environments</strong><br>Handcrafted levels based on a variety of mountainous landscapes. Each environment features unique mechanics for you to interact with and learn, combining the interesting platforming elements with puzzle solving.<br><br><br><strong>The Mountain</strong><br>Elements of the world change based on how you assist the mountain. The game is completable regardless of your choices, but the difficulty is up to you.",
